{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "sportpulse-supervision",
  "title": "SportPulse AI — Supervision technique",
  "description": "Supervision HTTP de l'API SportPulse AI et disponibilité des cibles Prometheus.",
  "tags": ["sportpulse", "fastapi", "prometheus", "monitoring"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volume de requêtes HTTP (req/s)",
      "description": "Débit global de requêtes reçues par l'API sur les cinq dernières minutes.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Requêtes/s",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Erreurs HTTP (%)",
      "description": "Part des réponses HTTP 4xx et 5xx parmi les requêtes.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 1},
              {"color": "red", "value": 5}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"4xx|5xx|4..|5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "Erreurs HTTP",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence p95 (secondes)",
      "description": "Temps de réponse sous lequel se situent 95 % des requêtes, estimé à partir de l'histogramme haute résolution.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 0.5},
              {"color": "red", "value": 1}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_highr_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "Latence p95",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilité de l'API",
      "description": "1 = cible joignable par Prometheus ; 0 = cible indisponible.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {"color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "DOWN"},
                "1": {"color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "UP"}
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(up{job=\"sportpulse-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "API SportPulse",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disponibilité des cibles supervisées",
      "description": "État des cibles actuellement configurées dans Prometheus : API et Prometheus.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 7, "x": 5, "y": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"sportpulse-api|prometheus\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requêtes par endpoint",
      "description": "Débit HTTP des routes de l'API, regroupé par handler.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (handler) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{handler}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Réponses par code HTTP",
      "description": "Débit de réponses regroupé par classe de statut HTTP.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Périmètre de supervision",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### État actuel\n\nCe dashboard supervise les métriques HTTP de **FastAPI** et la disponibilité des cibles **Prometheus** configurées. PostgreSQL, Kestra, Metabase et l'état interne des conteneurs Docker ne sont pas encore collectés par des exporters dédiés. La latence p95 est une estimation statistique issue de l'histogramme Prometheus."
      }
    }
  ]
}